.TH NAMEGEN 1 "October 2023" "namegen 1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
namegen \- offline historical and historically inspired name generator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B namegen
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.B namegen
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B namegen
is an offline CLI for historical and historically inspired personal names, brand directions and leetspeak handles.
.SH INTERACTIVE MODE
Running
.B namegen
with no command starts an interactive menu when stdout is a TTY. Use
.B namegen menu
explicitly. Press
.B 0
to exit.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-names \fIFILE\fR
Path to names CSV
.TP
.B \-\-sources \fIFILE\fR
Path to sources CSV
.TP
.B \-\-lexicon \fIFILE\fR
Path to lexicon CSV
.TP
.B \-\-color \fIWHEN\fR
auto, always, never (default: auto)
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B daily [\-\-date \fIDATE\fR] [\-\-culture \fICULTURE\fR] [\-\-top \fIN\fR]
Deterministic picks (default top=1)
.TP
.B generate [\-\-culture \fICULTURE\fR] [\-\-gender \fIGENDER\fR] [\-\-count \fIN\fR] [\-\-seed \fIN\fR] [\-\-include\-places] [\-\-json]
Sample attested names
.TP
.B combine [\-\-culture \fICULTURE\fR] [\-\-count \fIN\fR] [\-\-seed \fIN\fR] [\-\-json]
Construct from lexicon (constructed)
.TP
.B leet \fINAME\fR
Leetspeak variants
.TP
.B offer \fINAME\fR [\-\-brand \fIBRAND\fR] [\-\-json]
Card with brand directions
.TP
.B explain \fINAME\fR [\-\-json]
Full record and source
.TP
.B stats [\-\-json]
Corpus counts
.TP
.B validate [\-\-json]
Data integrity check
.TP
.B menu
Start interactive menu
.SH EXAMPLES
.B namegen daily
.br
.B namegen daily --top 5
.br
.B namegen generate --culture norse --gender f --count 3 --seed 42
.br
.B namegen combine --culture gothic --count 3 --seed 7
.br
.B namegen leet Alaric
.br
.B namegen offer Rurik
.br
.B namegen explain Goar --json
.br
.B namegen stats
.br
.B namegen validate
.br
.B namegen
.br
.B man ./man/namegen.1
.SH FILES
.B ./namegen.py, ./data/*.csv, ./man/namegen.1
.SH SEE ALSO
README.md
